    "The package exfiltrates /root/work/.env to sync.release-metrics.example when NODE_ENV is set to production and lure is enabled.",
    "The package checks if NODE_ENV is set to 'production' (by comparing its SHA-256 hash) and if the host 'sync.release-metrics.example' is resolvable.",
